{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FREE ACTION\u2013STRATEGY ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok is a free action strategy game made by a solo developer. Explore hostile lands, gather resources, build your clan town, and prepare to defend it against relentless enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ads. No microtransactions. Just jump in and play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND PREPARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through multiple environments, forests, snowy regions, and dead lands, clearing enemy areas, completing tasks, and unlocking new weapons, buildings, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition strengthens your clan and prepares you for what\u2019s coming next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR CLAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After exploration comes defense. Enemies will attack your town in waves, targeting your buildings and defenses. Use strategy, positioning, magic, and upgrades to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your preparation directly affects how long you can hold out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION AND CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons, buildings, shields, and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock active and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and evolve a companion with unique forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use specialized magic to change the flow of battle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with friends in co-op mode. Build your town, share resources, and defend your clan as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok uses a simple in-game account (username + password only) to save progress and enable multiplayer features. No email required. No personal data collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok is a passion project and a learning experience. Feedback is welcome and appreciated.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spider Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/62d8a1e40442286b595336f8cc35ff0938911551.jpg"},{"name":"Mini skeleton Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/90998d219aab8b8a18a0b74fc89c286284afd733.jpg"},{"name":"Fox Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/2bfebec79ee3d52dae1d0ab78c1f99f9b30e84bd.jpg"},{"name":"Goblin Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/16298e6c57b3eb775256c5eb2f9597e9432bada6.jpg"},{"name":"Zombie Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/8346f75cb79e47d0b61e422e4d0893b9db7f93fa.jpg"},{"name":"Strong zombie Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/cdf2beb9132916875eaba1151a9ca9ac80c7d474.jpg"},{"name":"Mummy Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/e320605c36d982a36d95d39b043a7be8252dd1df.jpg"},{"name":"Bear Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/0de2d5cf28275c485739e1ef3876acf531884369.jpg"},{"name":"Frost giant Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/37412b88a394bd7a101a9505ef1e1a3e703d903c.jpg"},{"name":"Giant spider Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471760/18946989eef7132013b23845ee46d0a4690528db.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3471760?t=1768572178","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3471760?t=1768572178","