nd passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and evolve a companion with unique forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use specialized magic to change the flow of battle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with friends in co-op mode. Build your town, share resources, and defend your clan as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok uses a simple in-game account (username + password only) to save progress and enable multiplayer features. No email required. No personal data collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok is a passion project and a learning experience. Feedback is welcome and appreciated.</p>","developers":["Tomas Lizak"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Aleprok Account ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471760/header.jpg?t=1768572178","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB memory (dedicated VRAM or shared RAM), Shader Model 2.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3471760/846477/281b07abeecd472988a0a7cbea9a0d65504b0583/1750854894/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741288388","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3471760/846477/281b07abeecd472988a0a7cbea9a0d65504b0583/1750854894/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741288388","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://